- Removed unused ViewController files - this files are default files that were generated when creating a new project;
- The View background color is changed to match the web default background color, this way the iOS safe area can almost match that background instead of being white;
- The web view scroll is now leaking it's content from it's size, this enables a feeling of continuity when scrolling;
- The scroll bouncing is removed from the web view to make the app feels less like a web page.

